The repository contains no data. Its scripts download, and the project's
GitHub Releases mirror redistributes, data from these sources:

  Flight on-time performance
    U.S. Department of Transportation, Bureau of Transportation Statistics,
    Reporting Carrier On-Time Performance (1987-present).
    https://www.transtats.bts.gov/
    U.S. government work, in the public domain.

  Weather observations and station metadata
    Iowa Environmental Mesonet (IEM), Iowa State University, ASOS/AWOS data.
    https://mesonet.agron.iastate.edu/
    IEM asks that it be credited when its data are used.

  Airport codes and locations
    OurAirports. https://ourairports.com/data/
    Released into the public domain.

  Aircraft registration
    Federal Aviation Administration, Releasable Aircraft Database.
    https://registry.faa.gov/
    U.S. government work, in the public domain.
